spect","video_id":"video:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw","aspect_type":"visual_signal","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"End card consolidates brand, CTA, or contact details.","aspect_value_normalized":"end card consolidates brand, cta, or contact details.","evidence_kind":"","evidence_lane":"","text":"","text_contains_http":"","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw:0001","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"source_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"additionalData\": {\"channelId\": \"UCAjKRiZ-UeH2Bz4Cu-ZEtUg\"}, \"author\": {\"displayName\": \"MTR Hong Kong\"}, \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-24T00:00:00.000Z\", \"platform\": \"youtube\", \"type\": \"video\"}","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw:0002","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"title_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"屯門南站纖巧設計融入發展成熟社區 Tuen Mun South Station Compact Design Integrates into Well-developed Community","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw:0003","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"description_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"【鐵路鑽深啲👷🏻‍♂️#社區鐵路篇：成熟社區起站挑戰💪】要喺樓宇林立、地底管綫密集嘅發展成熟社區「站」穩陣腳？靠嘅就係創新科技同精細規劃互相配合～屯門南站活用有限嘅空間將車站以架空形式，同纖巧嘅外型坐落喺一條交通要道上面🛣️ 大部份車站設施會置於高架樓層，月台同大堂就設喺同一層➡️令車站落成後，車站下方四條主要行車路得以保留🚗車站仲會連接現有行人天橋網絡，日後居民出行就更方便🔗 隨住車站地基工程大致完成，下一步就會全面進入結構建造階段喇🏗️ 即刻去片🎬率先了解屯門南站嘅設計巧思啦～ #港鐵 #屯門南延綫 #屯門南站 #空間大改造 #纖巧架空車站 #新鐵路建設無限未來 How do we secure a new station foothold in a bustling community packed with high-rise buildings and a maze of underground utilities? It takes innovative technology working hand in hand with meticulous planning. Positioned above a major traffic corridor, Tuen Mun South Station adopts a compact and elevated design that maximises the use of limited space 🛣️ By placing most station facilities on the elevated levels, the concourse and platforms will be located on the same level ➡️preserving the four traffic lanes beneath the station upon completion🚗 The station will also connect to the existing footbridge network, strengthening community connectivity 🔗 With station foundation works substantially completed, the project is set to move into the next major milestone: superstructure construction 🏗️Watch the video to learn more about the smart design behind Tuen Mun South Station🎬 #MTR #TuenMunSouthExtension #TuenMunSouthStation #NewRailwaysGoBeyond","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw:0004","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gebg70005bn5kiai0e7aw","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"author_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"displayName\": \"MTR Hong Kong\"}","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3